VERSION 120
CREATE BUTTON_DEFINITIONS

BUTTON NX2512_CONTROL_START_BRIDGE
LABEL Start Codex Live Bridge
TOOLBAR_LABEL Start Codex Live Bridge
MESSAGE Starts the local Codex live bridge inside the current NX process.
NO_REPEAT
ACCELERATOR Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B
ACTIONS nx2512_start_live_bridge.py

BUTTON NX2512_CONTROL_CREATE_TEST_PART
LABEL Create Codex Smoke Part
TOOLBAR_LABEL Create Codex Smoke Part
MESSAGE Creates a visible smoke-test modeling part in the current NX window.
NO_REPEAT
ACCELERATOR Ctrl+Alt+Shift+N
ACTIONS create_codex_smoke_part.py
